# AB-030: A carbonate solid moderates repeated acid additions until exhaustion
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CaCO3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
inspect v1
add v1 HCl 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
inspect v1
add v1 HCl 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
inspect v1
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
inspect
